=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，且<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r295.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r296.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r297.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r298.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r299.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r300.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r301.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r302.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r303.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_r304.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴乙的高＞甲的高＞丙的高<br><img src=\"img/9e9ff2_y104_image35.png\" width=\"159\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["104年會考"],"d":"難","html":1}]